{"seq":1,"slug":"quota-token-bucket","title":"配额令牌桶与原子预扣","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/api-gateway-quota-strategy/quota-metering-reserve/quota-token-bucket","wordCount":2222,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"配额令牌桶与原子预扣\">配额令牌桶与原子预扣</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>经典令牌桶的做法是：桶里最多放 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 个令牌，以每秒 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 个的速率补充，每个请求取走 1 个，取不到就拒绝。它的两个参数分别表达两件事——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 是<strong>长期平均速率</strong>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 是<strong>突发容忍度</strong>（桶越深，允许在空闲后一次性冲出的请求越多）。配额场景下这个模型要被改造两处，改造点决定了实现是否可用。</p>\n<p>第一处改造是<strong>加权成本</strong>：一次请求不等于一个令牌。导出接口可能消耗 100 个单位，一个轻量查询消耗 1 个，批量写消耗 50 个。改造方式是把「取走 1 个」换成「取走 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 个」，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 由接口组决定（见 <a href=\"../multi-dimension-quota/tenant-channel-market-quota\">按租户/渠道/市场/接口配额</a> 里的成本模型字段）。这立刻引出一个新问题：<strong>如果一个请求的权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 大于桶容量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 怎么办</strong>？它永远取不到令牌，会被永久拒绝。所以约束 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C \\ge \\max(w)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是配置校验的硬规则，否则会造出一类「无论怎么等都被拒」的请求，客户投诉时极难定位。</p>\n<p>第二处改造是<strong>检查与扣减的原子性</strong>。令牌桶的自然实现是「读余额 → 计算可用 → 写回」，这三步之间只要有一个请求插进来，就会超卖。用公式表达，一个桶在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 的可用令牌是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mi>C</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>last</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>last</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T(t) = \\min\\left(C,\\; T(t_{\\text{last}}) + r \\cdot (t - t_{\\text{last}})\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">last</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">last</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>请求要取走 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 个令牌，条件是新余额 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>T</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>w</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T&#x27;(t) = T(t) - w \\ge 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0019em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>。这里的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>last</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T(t_{\\text{last}})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">last</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>last</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{last}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">last</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是两个共享状态，两个并发请求各自读到的 <code>last</code> 相同时，就都会基于同一份「旧余额」计算，从而双双通过——这就是超卖的经典形态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"用-redis-实现原子预扣\">用 Redis 实现原子预扣</h2><p>令牌桶的公式天然适合「惰性补充」：不启动定时器去「加令牌」，而是在每次访问时用当前时间算出应当补充的量。这样存储里只需要 <code>tokens</code>（当前令牌数）和 <code>ts</code>（上次刷新时间）两个字段，加上配置里的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>在 Redis 上最稳健的做法是用 Lua 脚本，因为脚本在 Redis 单线程里原子执行，天然消除了「读与写之间的窗口」。核心逻辑伪代码是：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"lua\" data-code=\"-- KEYS[1]=配额键, ARGV: rate, capacity, cost, now_ms&#10;local data = redis.call(&#39;HMGET&#39;, KEYS[1], &#39;tokens&#39;, &#39;ts&#39;)&#10;local tokens = tonumber(data[1]) or capacity&#10;local ts     = tonumber(data[2]) or now_ms&#10;local elapsed = math.max(0, now_ms - ts)&#10;local refill  = elapsed * rate / 1000.0&#10;tokens = math.min(capacity, tokens + refill)&#10;local cost = tonumber(ARGV[3])&#10;if tokens &lt; cost then&#10;  redis.call(&#39;HSET&#39;, KEYS[1], &#39;tokens&#39;, tokens, &#39;ts&#39;, now_ms)&#10;  redis.call(&#39;PEXPIRE&#39;, KEYS[1], math.ceil(capacity / rate * 1000) + 60000)&#10;  return -1&#10;end&#10;tokens = tokens - cost&#10;redis.call(&#39;HSET&#39;, KEYS[1], &#39;tokens&#39;, tokens, &#39;ts&#39;, now_ms)&#10;redis.call(&#39;PEXPIRE&#39;, KEYS[1], math.ceil(capacity / rate * 1000) + 60000)&#10;return math.floor(tokens)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- KEYS[1]=配额键, ARGV: rate, capacity, cost, now_ms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local data = redis.call('HMGET', KEYS[1], 'tokens', 'ts')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local tokens = tonumber(data[1]) or capacity</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local ts     = tonumber(data[2]) or now_ms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local elapsed = math.max(0, now_ms - ts)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local refill  = elapsed * rate / 1000.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>tokens = math.min(capacity, tokens + refill)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local cost = tonumber(ARGV[3])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>if tokens &#x3C; cost then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  redis.call('HSET', KEYS[1], 'tokens', tokens, 'ts', now_ms)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  redis.call('PEXPIRE', KEYS[1], math.ceil(capacity / rate * 1000) + 60000)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return -1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>tokens = tokens - cost</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>redis.call('HSET', KEYS[1], 'tokens', tokens, 'ts', now_ms)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>redis.call('PEXPIRE', KEYS[1], math.ceil(capacity / rate * 1000) + 60000)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>return math.floor(tokens)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三个细节值得展开。<strong>其一，失败时也要写回</strong>：脚本拒绝请求时仍然把刷新后的 <code>tokens</code> 和 <code>ts</code> 写回，否则惰性补充在「一直被拒绝」的桶上永远累积不上——每次访问都从旧的 <code>ts</code> 重新算一遍很小的时间差，余额永远涨不上去。<strong>其二，TTL 的取值</strong>：桶在空闲后应被回收，过期时间设为「桶从空到满所需时间 + 余量」即可，因为此后即使不访问，桶也不会比满更多，重建它不损失信息。<strong>其三，返回值</strong>：返回剩余令牌数而不是布尔值，网关就能把它写进响应头（见 <a href=\"../over-quota-response/retry-after-quota\">429/Retry-After/配额头</a>），实现零成本的用量可见性。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant C as 客户端&#10;    participant G as 网关实例&#10;    participant R as Redis (Lua)&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;G: 请求 (cost=10)&#10;    G-&gt;&gt;R: EVALSHA quota_check key rate cap cost now&#10;    R-&gt;&gt;R: 读取 tokens/ts&#10;    R-&gt;&gt;R: 惰性补充 refill=ΔT·r&#10;    R-&gt;&gt;R: tokens ≥ cost ?&#10;    alt 足够&#10;        R-&gt;&gt;R: tokens -= cost, 写回&#10;        R--&gt;&gt;G: 剩余令牌数&#10;        G-&gt;&gt;G: 放行并转发上游&#10;    else 不足&#10;        R-&gt;&gt;R: 仅刷新, 写回&#10;        R--&gt;&gt;G: -1&#10;        G--&gt;&gt;C: 429 + 配额头&#10;    end\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant C as 客户端\n    participant G as 网关实例\n    participant R as Redis (Lua)\n    C-&gt;&gt;G: 请求 (cost=10)\n    G-&gt;&gt;R: EVALSHA quota_check key rate cap cost now\n    R-&gt;&gt;R: 读取 tokens/ts\n    R-&gt;&gt;R: 惰性补充 refill=ΔT·r\n    R-&gt;&gt;R: tokens ≥ cost ?\n    alt 足够\n        R-&gt;&gt;R: tokens -= cost, 写回\n        R--&gt;&gt;G: 剩余令牌数\n        G-&gt;&gt;G: 放行并转发上游\n    else 不足\n        R-&gt;&gt;R: 仅刷新, 写回\n        R--&gt;&gt;G: -1\n        G--&gt;&gt;C: 429 + 配额头\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"幂等-重试与脚本预加载\">幂等、重试与脚本预加载</h2><p><code>EVALSHA</code> 需要脚本先被 <code>SCRIPT LOAD</code>。常见故障是 Redis 重启或主从切换后脚本缓存丢失，<code>EVALSHA</code> 报 <code>NOSCRIPT</code>，如果网关没处理这个错误就整片拒绝。标准做法是回退到 <code>EVAL</code> 全量脚本并在本地缓存 <code>sha1</code>，或者启动时主动预加载全部配额脚本。Go 的 <code>go-redis</code>、Java 的 Lettuce 等客户端库通常提供 <code>Script</code> 抽象自动处理这个回退，但自研客户端必须显式实现。</p>\n<p><strong>重试语义</strong>同样要注意。配额预扣是「有副作用的操作」，如果网关向 Redis 发请求后超时、不确定是否执行成功，盲目重试可能导致重复扣减。这与幂等键注册服务处理的问题同构：要么让预扣操作本身幂等，要么接受重复扣减并在事后对账。实践中，配额预扣的轻微重复扣减（少见且金额小）通常被接受为「宁可少给客户一点点额度，也不引入一次额外的存储往返」；但在合同额度巨大的企业客户上，这个取舍要重新评估——这也是 <a href=\"quota-reserve-release\">预扣/释放/补偿</a> 要处理的场景。</p>\n<p>一个常被忽略的性能陷阱是<strong>哈希槽与热点键</strong>。如果配额键落在同一个 Redis 实例上（比如按租户哈希后大客户集中在少数槽），这个实例会成为瓶颈。缓解手段有两种：对同一逻辑桶做<strong>分片计数器</strong>（把 1 个桶拆成 N 个，请求随机选一个，各片独立扣减，总额度 = N × 单桶），牺牲精确度换吞吐；或者用 Redis Cluster 的键哈希标签（hash tag）保证同一租户的多个周期键落在同一节点，减少跨节点事务需求。前者是第三章「允许超卖」策略的雏形，后者用于保证多键操作的可行性。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>实现要点</th>\n<th>错误做法</th>\n<th>后果</th>\n<th>正确做法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>检查+扣减</td>\n<td>分两次命令</td>\n<td>并发超卖</td>\n<td>单个 Lua 脚本内完成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拒绝时写回</td>\n<td>直接 return 不写</td>\n<td>桶永远补不上</td>\n<td>写回刷新后的 tokens/ts</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>脚本缓存</td>\n<td>只用 EVALSHA</td>\n<td>重启后全量 NOSCRIPT</td>\n<td>回退 EVAL + 本地缓存 sha1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>桶容量</td>\n<td>允许 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C &lt; \\max(w)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>重请求永久被拒</td>\n<td>配置校验 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C \\ge \\max(w)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过期回收</td>\n<td>不设 TTL</td>\n<td>键无限增长</td>\n<td>TTL = 满桶时间 + 余量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>热点桶</td>\n<td>单键承载全部流量</td>\n<td>实例 CPU 打满</td>\n<td>分片计数或 hash tag</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"成本模型怎么定\">成本模型怎么定</h2><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 的取值不是工程细节，而是把「后端真实代价」翻译成配额的建模决策，它同时影响公平性与商业定价。三种定法各有适用面：</p>\n<p><strong>按请求数记账（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>）</strong>：最简单，客户最容易理解「你买了每天 10 万次调用」。缺点是重接口与轻接口等价，客户可能用少量重请求（比如每次导出全量数据）实际占用远超额度对应的容量。适合接口同质的 API（比如纯查询服务）。</p>\n<p><strong>按令牌成本表（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 由接口组映射）</strong>：平台为每个接口组定一个成本值，写入配额配置。能给重接口定价，同时保持「客户能读懂成本表」。这是绝大多数 SaaS API 的做法，AWS 的 API Gateway 计量、Stripe 的 API 用量计价、云厂商的「请求单位」概念都属于这一类。</p>\n<p><strong>按实际资源消耗动态计算（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 由运行时决定）</strong>：比如按返回行数、消耗的 CPU 时间或扫描的数据量计费（AWS 的 Lambda 计费、BigQuery 的按扫描字节计费是典型）。最公平，但要求结算在<strong>响应完成后</strong>才成立，无法在请求入境时预扣——网关只能先按估算值预扣，再在响应后按实际值结算差额。这直接引出 <a href=\"quota-reserve-release\">预扣/释放/补偿</a> 里的两阶段模型。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>成本模型</th>\n<th>客户可理解性</th>\n<th>公平性</th>\n<th>能否入境时判定</th>\n<th>典型代表</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>按请求数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低（同质接口才公平）</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>简单查询 API</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成本表 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>cost</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>g</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w=\\text{cost}(group)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cost</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>中高</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>多数 SaaS 网关</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动态实际消耗</td>\n<td>低（需事后解释）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>否，需两阶段</td>\n<td>按量计费的计算/查询服务</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>成本表的数值定法上有一条经验：<strong>让成本大致与后端资源占用成比例，而不必精确</strong>。把一次搜索查询定成 5、一次写入定成 1、一次导出定成 100，比「精确测量每次调用耗时再换算」要好——因为后者会让配额在不同时刻漂移，客户无法预测，且实现复杂度陡增。可预测性对 API 消费者比绝对公平更重要。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>配额桶 = 令牌桶 + 加权成本（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 由接口组决定）+ 惰性补充；配置必须满足 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C \\ge \\max(w)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，否则重请求永久被拒。</li>\n<li>检查与扣减必须在单个原子单元内完成；Redis 上用一个 Lua 脚本完成「读取 → 补充 → 比较 → 扣减 → 写回」。</li>\n<li>拒绝分支也必须写回刷新后的余额，否则惰性补充永远累积不上；桶要设 TTL（满桶时间 + 余量）以回收空闲键。</li>\n<li>返回剩余令牌数而非布尔值，让网关能把它写进响应头，免费得到用量可见性。</li>\n<li><code>EVALSHA</code> 必须处理 <code>NOSCRIPT</code> 回退；预扣超时后的重试要考虑重复扣减，用幂等或事后对账兜住。</li>\n<li>成本模型从「按请求数」到「成本表」到「动态实际消耗」逐级更公平但更难解释、更难在入境时判定，后者需要第二章第三节的两阶段结算。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"配额令牌桶与原子预扣","id":"配额令牌桶与原子预扣"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"用 Redis 实现原子预扣","id":"用-redis-实现原子预扣"},{"level":2,"text":"幂等、重试与脚本预加载","id":"幂等-重试与脚本预加载"},{"level":2,"text":"成本模型怎么定","id":"成本模型怎么定"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"多维配额的组合判定","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/api-gateway-quota-strategy/multi-dimension-quota/quota-dimension-combine"},"next":{"title":"跨实例全局配额一致性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/api-gateway-quota-strategy/quota-metering-reserve/global-distributed-quota"}}